# Project: {{project_name}} — Operations & Architecture Manual

## Overview
`{{project_slug}}` is an Antigravity-managed workspace configured for the **{{archetype}}** archetype. It integrates a local Obsidian markdown knowledge base, domain-tailored architecture components, a local PostgreSQL cross-reference database, and Google Cloud Firestore 3-tier goal management.

