## Cadence CLI Commands (`scripts/cadence.py`)

Target Firestore Collection: `{{firestore_collection}}`

```bash
# List active daily goals
python3 scripts/cadence.py list --scope daily --status in_progress

# Create a new daily goal
python3 scripts/cadence.py create --title "Implement feature" --scope daily --phase {{default_phase}}

# Advance goal phase
python3 scripts/cadence.py advance <goal_id> --phase {{next_phase}}

# Complete goal
python3 scripts/cadence.py complete <goal_id>

# Run weekly sync rituals
python3 scripts/cadence.py week-plan
```

