## PostgreSQL Database Queries (`wiki` db)

All queries must filter by `repo = '{{postgres_repo_key}}'`:

```sql
-- Find pages by tag
SELECT path, title, summary FROM wiki_pages
WHERE repo = '{{postgres_repo_key}}' AND 'governance' = ANY(tags);

-- Find orphan pages (must be 0)
SELECT * FROM wiki_orphans WHERE repo = '{{postgres_repo_key}}';

-- Inbound cross-references
SELECT source_path, target_slug FROM wiki_links
WHERE repo = '{{postgres_repo_key}}';
```

